98
00:06:10.170 --> 00:06:12.706
No pensé que me lo permitieran.

99
00:06:12.806 --> 00:06:15.242
La familia de Harry.

100
00:06:15.375 --> 00:06:16.944
Así es tu caso.

101
00:06:19.012 --> 00:06:21.515
La mala noticia es...

102
00:06:21.615 --> 00:06:23.182
